## Article 4. Key definitions as Catala scopes

```catala
declaration scope Article4PublicLawDispute:
  input defendant content SubjectOfAuthority
  input involvesAdministrativeServices content YesNo
  input involvesElectionProcess content YesNo
  input isPublicLawDispute content YesNo

scope Article4PublicLawDispute:
  label authority_dispute exception not_dispute_default
  definition isPublicLawDispute under condition
    defendant.actsInPublicCapacity = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label service_dispute exception not_dispute_default
  definition isPublicLawDispute under condition
    involvesAdministrativeServices = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label election_dispute exception not_dispute_default
  definition isPublicLawDispute under condition
    involvesElectionProcess = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_dispute_default definition isPublicLawDispute equals No

declaration scope Article4SubjectOfAuthorityCheck:
  input entity content SubjectOfAuthority
  output isSubjectOfAuthority content YesNo

scope Article4SubjectOfAuthorityCheck:
  label authority_check_exception exception not_authority_default
  definition isSubjectOfAuthority under condition
    entity.kind = StateBody
    or entity.kind = LocalSelfGov
    or entity.kind = MilitaryAuthority
    or entity.kind = Official
    or entity.kind = DelegatedPowers
    or entity.kind = AdministrativeServiceProvider
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_authority_default definition isSubjectOfAuthority equals No
```
